\newlabel{fig4}{{4}{11}{\textbf {Full 8-Model LOPO Accuracy Benchmark and Patient Generalization Heatmap.} Panel A compares LOPO accuracy across 4 model families for Base Paper (red bars) vs. Our Work (green bars) with explicit delta callouts. Panel B displays the subject-by-subject LOPO accuracy heatmap across all 8 models for representative CHB-MIT patients}{figure.caption.9}{}}
